    terms: [['Anytime algorithm', 'Produces a usable answer quickly and better answers given more time.'], ['Metareasoning', 'Reasoning about which computations to perform.'], ['Value of computation', 'The expected improvement in decision quality from a computation, minus its cost.'], ['Bounded optimality', 'Being the best possible agent given the computational limits of its architecture.']],
